      "data_as_of is the cover's own situation date, not the posting date and not the upstream series column. INRB-UMIE's series dates SitRep 85 to 2026-08-08 while that edition's PDF prints 07 August, so the series column is not used as a date basis.",
      "INRB-UMIE's record of this edition is a transcription of the same LinkedIn packet, so it corroborates rather than sources these figures. ECDC is secondary corroboration.",
